text Route133_Text_BeckDefeat {
    "You…\nYou're stunningly cool!"
}

text Route133_Text_BeckIntro {
    "I came all the way out here with my\nBIRD POKéMON."
}

text Route133_Text_BeckPostBattle {
    "I'd like to go back to FORTREE,\nbut I've grown to like this place, too."
}

text Route133_Text_ConorDefeat {
    "You have a firm sense of purpose."
}

text Route133_Text_ConorIntro {
    "Young people are too happy to go with\nthe flow. They're without direction."
}

text Route133_Text_ConorPostBattle {
    "Don't let others lead you astray.\nDon't lose direction as you grow older."
}

text Route133_Text_DebraDefeat {
    "Another loss…"
}

text Route133_Text_DebraIntro {
    "I've led a life of woe and misery…\nI've been cast away, and this is where\nI've drifted…"
}

text Route133_Text_DebraPostBattle {
    "A life adrift…\nI don't want it anymore!"
}

text Route133_Text_FranklinDefeat {
    "Strong!\nToo much so!"
}

text Route133_Text_FranklinIntro {
    "Did the currents carry you here, too?\nThis must have been fated.\nLet's battle!"
}

text Route133_Text_FranklinPostBattle {
    "It's just my luck that a tough TRAINER\nlike you would drift here…\nI must be cursed…"
}

text Route133_Text_LindaDefeat {
    "No! Please!"
}

text Route133_Text_LindaIntro {
    "Welcome!\nI've been expecting you!"
}

text Route133_Text_LindaPostBattle {
    "A strong child TRAINER…\nThat's so annoying!"
}

text Route133_Text_MollieDefeat {
    "I may have lost thousands of times,\nbut a loss still stings."
}

text Route133_Text_MollieIntro {
    "I must have battled thousands\nof times. I've lost count."
}

text Route133_Text_MolliePostBattle {
    "Keep at this, youngster. So you can\nbecome like my husband and me."
}

text Route133_Text_WarrenDefeat {
    "Darn it!\nMy way is still too slack!"
}

text Route133_Text_WarrenIntro {
    "I want to win like everyone else, but I\nwon't raise POKéMON like everyone else."
}

text Route133_Text_WarrenPostBattle {
    "It's way more fun to do things the way\nI want than to be like everybody else.\nI mean, that's obvious!"
}